# Vendored reference books (NNG4, logic_and_proof, TPIL, MIL) — each carries its own .git;
# read-only, not our work. Keep only our provenance note.
/references/*
!/references/README.md

# Lean build artifacts & toolchains
**/.lake/
**/lake-packages/

# Answers saved before resetting exercises
/course/.exercise-backups/
**/__pycache__/

# Quarto / Typst render byproducts — regenerable via `make explainer` / `make docs`
# (we commit the .qmd sources and the figs/, not the rendered output)
**/.quarto/
**/explainer_files/
**/*.typ
**/*.html
**/*.pdf

# Local agent / editor / OS junk
/.claude/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.swp
